# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: admits no offender outside the shrink-only allowlist")
for path in ASM_BEARING:
    if offends(path):
        expect(ALLOWED_OFFENDERS.contains(path)).to_be(true)
```

